.tui-artifacts/

# Captures belong to whatever project was being driven, not to this one. `tui render`
# and `tui snap --png` keep them in the session store by default, but an explicit
# `--out` can still aim anywhere, and this repo is a convenient cwd.
screenshots/
*.png
*.svg
!docs/*.png
!docs/*.svg
